==Buy Phase==
===Match Start===
*{{AC|KilljoyMatchStart1.mp3}} "I built literally everything on this battlefield. Ja, even the things that might kill us. What? You want me to say sorry?"
*{{AC|KilljoyMatchStart2.mp3}} "Okay, I put together some data on our last six combat missions. Did you read it? Did anyone read it? Oh God, can anyone here read?"
*{{AC|KilljoyMatchStart3.mp3}} "Don't worry team. If you die, I have your memories backed up at base! Heh, just kidding, just kidding. Or am I?"
*{{AC|KilljoyMatchStart4.mp3}} "Swarm grenades? Check. Killer robots? Check- oh, hah, don't worry, they're only killer when I say so."
*{{AC|KilljoyMatchStart5.mp3}} "If I'm not stressed, then you should not be stressed. I mean, look at me. Cool as a cucumber." ''*Killjoy laughs*'' "Ja, that's a thing Americans say, right?"
*{{AC|KilljoyMatchStart6.mp3}} "These imposters actually think they can beat my tech? Ah, let's test that theory."
*{{AC|KilljoyMatchStart7.mp3}} "Why is no one wearing the pulse monitors I gave you? Honestly, I ask for a few readouts and you think I'm Doctor Frankenstein!"

====Attacking====
*{{AC|KilljoyMatchStartAttack1.mp3}} "Let's make this extraction quick. After this I'm going clubbing five timezones away, and a girl needs a moment to change."
*{{AC|KilljoyMatchStartAttack2.mp3}} "Oh! Oh! What if I sabotaged their defuser to speed up the timer instead! Oh man, how funny would that be!"

====Defending====
*{{AC|KilljoyMatchStartDefense1.mp3}} "Stealing our radianite is one thing, but I swear if they touch my coffee mug collection, I will erase them from existence."
*{{AC|KilljoyMatchStartDefense2.mp3}} "Meine güte! How many spikes do they have anyway? That tech's not cheap."
**(''Meine güte'': My goodness)

====[[Bind]]====
*{{AC|KilljoyMatchStartBind.mp3}} "If this town had let me install my defense matrix, we wouldn't have to be here! Ugh, oh well, I'll clean this up myself."

====[[Fracture]]====
*{{AC|KilljoyMatchStartFracture.mp3}} "Alpha this, Omega that, scheiße, who named these universes?! A und B would work perfectly well. We would be A, of course."
**(''Scheiße'': Shit)
**(''Und'': And)

